  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of the endemic Grauer&apos;s gorilla in Kahuzi Biega National Park, DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to increase protection of the great apes and other wildlife of Kahuzi Biega National Park by expanding law enforcement and applied research efforts to improve the management capacity of ICCN (Institut Congolais pour la Conservation de la Nature), the wildlife and protected area authority of the Democratic Republic of Congo who are responsible for protecting the park. The recipient will increase coordination among partners to implement the research and monitoring plan in accordance with protection objectives; improve capacity and methods for more efficient data collection; and continue to support law enforcement and monitoring patrols.</narrative>
  </description>
